.TH XANARA 1 "October 2026" "SDE" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
xanara \- read, annotate and edit PDF documents
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B xanara
[\fB\-\-page=\fIN\fR] [\fIFILE\fR...]
.br
.B xanara
\fB\-\-version\fR | \fB\-\-help\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B Xanara
is the document viewer and PDF editor of the Selviana Desktop Environment,
written from scratch by the DebION Dev-Team on poppler and cairo.
.PP
Pages are rendered at the exact resolution of the screen (zoom times the
SDE interface scale) in 512 pixel tiles on a background thread, and kept in a
memory bounded cache. While the zoom changes, a scaled preview is shown; the
sharp rendering follows as soon as the zoom settles.
.PP
Reading: continuous, single page and two\-page (book) layouts; fit width, fit
page or any zoom (Ctrl+wheel); rotation; page thumbnails, the document outline
and a list of annotations in the sidebar; find with highlighted results; text
selection and copy; internal and web links; presentation mode; night and
sepia reading modes; recent documents and the last page of each document;
password protected PDFs; printing through the CUPS
.BR lp (1)
command.
.PP
Editing: highlight, underline and strike out text; sticky notes; text boxes;
freehand pen drawings; rectangles and lines; a signature image; moving,
recolouring and deleting annotations, with undo; filling in form fields (text,
check boxes, radio buttons and lists). Pages can be rotated, moved, inserted
from another PDF, deleted and extracted when
.BR qpdf (1)
is installed.
.PP
Saving writes a complete new file next to the original and renames it over
the original only after it was written and read back successfully, so an
interrupted save never damages the document. Closing a document with unsaved
changes asks whether to save them.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI \-\-page= N
Open the first
.I FILE
at page
.I N
(1 is the first page).
.TP
.B \-\-version
Print the version and the poppler version.
.TP
.B \-\-help
Print a short usage summary.
.PP
Further files open in windows of their own.
.I FILE
may also be a file:// URI.
.SH KEYS
.TP
.B Ctrl+O, Ctrl+S, Ctrl+Shift+S, Ctrl+P, Ctrl+W, Ctrl+Q
Open, save, save a copy, print, close the document, quit.
.TP
.B Ctrl+F, Enter, Shift+Enter, F3
Find, next and previous result.
.TP
.B Ctrl+wheel, Ctrl++, Ctrl+\-, Ctrl+0, Ctrl+1, Ctrl+2
Zoom, 100\ %, fit page, fit width.
.TP
.B Ctrl+R, Ctrl+Shift+R, Ctrl+Left, Ctrl+Right
Rotate the view.
.TP
.B Ctrl+L
Go to a page number.
.TP
.B Ctrl+M
Cycle normal, night and sepia reading.
.TP
.B F5, F9, F11
Presentation, sidebar, full screen.
.TP
.B V H U K N T P R L G
Tools: select, highlight, underline, strike out, sticky note, text box, pen,
rectangle, line, signature.
.TP
.B Delete, Ctrl+Z, Esc
Delete the selected annotation, undo, leave the current tool.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/sde/sde.conf
The
.B [xanara]
section keeps the layout, reading mode, sidebar and
.B cache_mb
(rendered tile cache in MiB, default 224).
.TP
.I ~/.local/state/sde/xanara\-history
Recent documents and the last page and zoom of each.
.SH NOTES
With poppler older than the release that can create FreeText and Ink
annotations natively, text boxes and pen drawings are stored as image stamps
that look the same in every PDF viewer.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR qpdf (1),
.BR lp (1),
.BR sde-settings (1)
